  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Bridges: Women Peacebuilders Reclaim Peace, Redefine Security</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected effects for the target group of the Project are (Outcome).

Outcome 1: Women-led CSOs and WPBs systematically participate in dialogues with security actors, including on TJ, DDR, and SSR, to advance inclusive and gender-responsive approaches to peace, reconciliation, and security issues.
Outcome 2: Women-led CSOs and WPBs localize peace and reconciliation processes and foster social cohesion through community-level interventions.
Outcome 3: Women-led CSOs and WPBs are better protected and able to safely influence peace and reconciliation processes.</narrative>
  </description>
